# Supplier Performance Analytics

## Objective

The objective of this module is to evaluate supplier performance using operational and procurement metrics to support sourcing and vendor management decisions.

Key evaluation criteria include:

- On-Time Delivery (OTD)
- Lead Time
- Product Quality
- Annual Spend
- Supplier Reliability

